                      "fill": "$ink-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The thing moves and its consequence trails by a beat. A button face lifts on ease-spring over 350ms while its hard ink offset slides out 40ms behind it. An accordion fold runs 350ms and the ink settles a half beat later.",
